Z||000007||FieroLT1||05-08-2001||07:41 AM||||You may contact Archie about the car.<BR>A quick note about it;<BR>I have seen this car first hand and had the pleasure to meet Mr. Warber, before his untimely departure, and I must say he was a great man and his dedication to this car was unparallel. I saw him swipe trophies left and right with this car. Always "Best of Class" winner. Who ever gets this car will not only be getting an awesome machine, but also a great memory.<P><P>------------------<BR>Winston Ojeda<BR><B>88 Formula LT1</B><BR>Milwaukee, Wisconsin, USA<BR><A HREF="http://www.FieroLT1.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.FieroLT1.com</A><BR><I>Home of the Fiero LT1</I><BR> <A HREF="mailto:wojeda@FieroLT1.com">wojeda@FieroLT1.com</A> ||||reg||1
