Z||000010||Oreif||05-08-2001||09:16 PM||||   <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Old Lar:<BR><B>The black chop top above is the late Rich Warber's car.  The blue chop top was Archie's creation.  Two of the best choptop Fiero's around.  The blue one was up for sale.  I don't know what the status of the Warber creation is.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>The pics don't show the color well but it isn't black it is a very deep purple (Hence the name). This car is has excellent craftsmanship and is for sale. Although the price is high for a Fiero, it is low for the quality and craftmanship of the vehicle. Too bad I don't have the money for it.<BR>For more info you can get a discription on NIFE's website or see pics on Archie's site.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.v8archie.com/warberfs.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.v8archie.com/warberfs.htm</A> <P><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 05-08-2001).]||||reg||1
